  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/From_Magic_to_Tech/BH_FMTT_header\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/From_Magic_to_Tech/BH_FMTT_header.wep\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/From_Magic_to_Tech/BH_FMTT_header.webp\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\"><strong>從魔法到科技</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">在這個模組包中，你將展開一段可以自由探索的冒險。前往太空、建造核子反應爐、搭配 Create 模組打造巨型農場、探索世界，或是用魔法摧毀一切？只要你想，你都能做到。&nbsp; 這個模組包收錄了適合各種玩家的模組。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">（<strong>所有特色與 Discord 伺服器資訊如下</strong>）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">加入 Minecraft 社群伺服器！&nbsp; IP：184.170.200.219:25565 或 fmtt.mcserver.us</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif;font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif;font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/From_Magic_to_Tech/BH_FMTT_features.webp\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">超過 300 個模組</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">JourneyMap</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">Create 模組</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">傳送石</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">自訂動態選單</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">Complementary 光影 v5，作者：<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/EminGTR/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">EminGTR</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">新武器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">新建築</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">新生物</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">新首領</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">火箭與行星</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">新食物與作物</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">新生態域</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">進入終界的新方式</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">新的終界與地獄維度</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">馴服龍</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\">MineColonies</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif;font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fcuUaqmDFzR\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/From_Magic_to_Tech/BH_FMTT_discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fcuUaqmDFzR\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入 Discord 伺服器：&nbsp; https://discord.com/invite/cuUaqmDFzR</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\"><strong>遊戲截圖：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/111522952/253256407-fc305cff-a8d8-4149-861c-b8122186aaac.png\" alt=\"遊戲截圖 2\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/111522952/257009304-f64c84b2-d7c6-4e16-bb69-9aba30b37319.png\" alt=\"遊戲截圖 3\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/111522952/257009322-a4e66e69-f1af-4dbb-84b3-c9688f7bdeff.png\" alt=\"遊戲截圖 4\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\"><strong>暮色森林</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Gabriele-333/FMTT/assets/111522952/b9c1ce84-a702-46fd-af38-44f127ba4d36\" alt=\"遊戲截圖 5\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;times new roman&#x27;, times, serif\"><strong>地下花園</strong></span></p>",
